{"type":"Film","id":"FR2016_107","slug":"fr2016-107-camping-3","title":{"native":"Camping 3","english":"Camping 3"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-06-29","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Fabien Onteniente","slug":"fabien-onteniente","name":"Fabien Onteniente","birthYear":1958,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/90/113/160090/format_page/camping-3.jpg","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yHRgemmfRPY"},"synopsis":{"native":"Comme chaque été, au Camping des Flots Bleus se retrouvent pour leurs vacances nos amis, Les Pic, Jacky et Laurette, Gatineau, tout juste divorcé de Sophie, le 37, et Patrick Chirac fidèle à ses habitudes. Cette année, Patrick a décidé de tester le co-voiturage... Pensant traverser la France avec Vanessa, il se retrouve avec trois jeunes dijonnais : Robert le charmeur, Benji le beau gosse et José la grande gueule. Bien évidemment, après le co-voiturage, Patrick se voit contraint de tester le co-couchage…","english":"Like every summer, our friends, the Pics, Jacky and Laurette, Gatineau, recently divorced from Sopie, and Patrick Chirac, ever true to form, get together at the Blue Waves camping grounds. This year, Patrick has decided to try car sharing. Believing that he'll travel through France alone with Vanessa, he finds himself accompanied by three young Dijon inhabitants: smooth-talking Robert, good-looking Benji and loudmouth José. Of course, after car sharing Patrick is forced to try out bed sharing..."},"production":[{"country":"France","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Belgium","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Alain Gautré","slug":"alain-gautre","name":"Alain Gautré","birthYear":1951,"deathYear":2017,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"France","awards":[]},"role":"Minor actor/Cameo"},{"person":{"id":"Antoine Dul